; Proxy surface: byte-for-byte the export names of the stock shim, which is what
; NURSEUS.EXE imports (E02 §imports: fakecdda.dll -> mciSendCommandA,
; mixerSetControlDetails; the stock DLL's export table — same three names — is in E01,
; `original/fakecdda.dll` section).
; Keep undecorated: the host IAT is filled by name.
EXPORTS
    mciSendCommandA
    mciSendStringA
    mixerSetControlDetails
